"shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Yl7UIESx3gl10kEwP0Djhg","review_id":"MSwm0xuCKkRHTE6oB7lC6A","date":"2013-08-15T23:25:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9421781897544861,"text_excerpt":"Oooh. I had yummy croissants from here this morning. So good. Nice and fresh and I like how there is an outer thick \"crust\" with the soft inside. They are so delicious, no butter or anything else needed. They also sell danish and other pastries. Perfect little neighborhood breakfast spot, if you are looking to pick up something that isn't a doughnut or a bagel."},{"business_id":"Yl7UIESx3gl10kEwP0Djhg","review_id":"nqemZ9LmrzWYbVNWQI6xdA","date":"2013-02-23T16:57:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.939329981803894,"text_excerpt":"The sight of this place name puts a smile on me. Being I can't be in Paris currently eating a chocolate croissant outside, this is the next best thing for me right here in New Orleans. Upon entrance to La Boulangerie you should have an instant smile, it you don't something is obviously wrong with you. The smells and all of the beautiful items is sensory overload and truly makes it tough to make a decision on what you want to get. Everything is just so fresh! I recently went with a chocolate and raspberry croissant. They were divine even without warming up. The bread was fluffy, fresh and it was just the right amount of chocolate and raspberry in each without being too extreme at all. I al..."},{"business_id":"Yl7UIESx3gl10kEwP0Djhg","review_id":"-JzLaqCQCB6L5xhEmhEhmQ","date":"2012-12-24T21:08:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9381188154220581,"text_excerpt":"C'est bon! This is one of the few \"French\" bakeries in the U.S. that I've found makes almond croissants as flaky (good in pastries, not in people), buttery, and delicious as that small patisserie in the Marais arrondisement of Paris. Big space that is taken up largely by the baking operation on premise. Besides bread and pastries, it also has coffee. There's always a line in the mornings but it is well worth the wait."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Yl7UIESx3gl10kEwP0Djhg","photo_id":"ULrwzhpBqIrck7rjvZqKpg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ULrwzhpBqIrck7rjvZqKpg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8927279710769653},{"business_id":"Yl7UIESx3gl10kEwP0Djhg","photo_id":"NTsZs-GxwZdgSRZyqrpgZw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NTsZs-GxwZdgSRZyqrpgZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8595388531684875},{"business_id":"Yl7UIESx3gl10kEwP0Djhg","photo_id":"n3gwpNQ_lLBTI8m1JyEFOg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/n3gwpNQ_lLBTI8m1JyEFOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8518636226654053},{"business_id":"Yl7UIESx3gl10kEwP0Djhg","photo_id":"MLCGt-fRohSgJvsorIhIfQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/MLCGt-fRohSgJvsorIhIfQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8360552787780762}]},"notebook_case":null}
